    "bounding box" : [ 55.276, 376.948, 556.726, 420.534 ],
    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Firstly, observe that every vertex of U has degree at most 2t in Hi for each i ∈ [k] by construction, and that every vertex vi in X has degree exactly r in H, so the second condition in b) holds. Thus, we only need to show that |X| ≥ 2(logε|Un|)c holds."
